  "title": "Savory Herb Waffles",
  "description": "These are not a sweet waffle! I use them to serve creamed beef or chicken for a quick, easy supper. They are very light, very tasty, and they smell heavenly.",
  "authors": [
    "Deb McMeen"
  ],
